@startuml cu80
!theme plain
title CU80 — Administrar Cuadernos de Folios

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) requests new folio notebooks for a protocol and year.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Presents the available folios ordered by consecutive numbering.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) indicates the folio count or the range to group.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Checks that the count is a multiple of 10 and the numbering is continuous with no gaps.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) confirms generation of the notebooks.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Groups the folios by tens, assigns consecutive numbering, and updates the status to "Asignados a cuaderno".
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) requests the cover of a specific notebook.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Generates the official cover layout with year, register, notebook number, range, and detail.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) proceeds to print the cover.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Enables printing on official paper or PDF export of the cover.
System -> System : System

@enduml
